hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"183","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman, qala: Haddasana Saeed bin Sulaiman, 'an Abbad bin Al-Awwam, 'an Humaid, 'an Anas: ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko ath-thufl pasand tha. Abdullah ne kaha: ya'ni jo khaane mein baqee rahay."
"184","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani', qala: Haddasana Ismail bin Ibrahim, 'an Ayyub, 'an Ibn Abi Mulaykah, 'an Ibn Abbas, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam khalaa se nikle, toh unhein khaana pesh kiya gaya. Logon ne kaha: Kya hum aap ke paas wuzu le kar aayein? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe toh sirf us waqt wuzu ka hukm diya gaya hai jab main namaz ke liye khada hoon."
"185","[AI-translation] Haddasana Saeed bin Abdur Rahman Al-Makhzumi, qala: Haddasana Sufyan bin Uyaynah, 'an Amr bin Dinar, 'an Saeed bin Al-Huwayrith, 'an Ibn Abbas, qala: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ghait se nikle toh unhein khaana laaya gaya. Un se kaha gaya: Kya aap wuzu nahi karte? Toh aap ne farmaya: Kya main namaz padhta hoon, jis liye wuzu karoon?"
"186","[AI-translation] Haddasana Yahya bin Musa, qala: Haddasana Abdullah bin Numayr, qala: Haddasana Qays bin Ar-Rabi' (h) wa Haddasana Qutaybah, qala: Haddasana Abd al-Karim Al-Jurjani, 'an Qays bin Ar-Rabi', 'an Abi Hashim, 'an Zazan, 'an Salman, qala: Maine Taurat mein padha ke khaane ki barkat us ke baad wuzu hai, toh main ne yeh baat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko bata di, aur unhein Taurat mein jo padha tha us ki khabar di. Toh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Khaane ki barkat us se pehle wuzu hai, aur us ke baad wuzu."
"187","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaybah bin Saeed, qala: Haddasana Ibn Luhay'ah, 'an Yazid bin Abi Habib, 'an Rashid bin Jandal Al-Yafi'i, 'an Habib bin Aws, 'an Abi Ayyub Al-Ansari, qala: Hum ek din Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas the, toh khaana pesh kiya gaya. Main ne aisa khaana nahi dekha jo pehle khane mein us se zyada barkat wala ho, aur aakhir mein us se kam barkat wala ho. Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Yeh kaisa hua? Aap ne farmaya: Hum ne jab khaya toh Allah ka naam liya, phir woh baith gaya jis ne khaya aur Allah ta'ala ka naam nahi liya, toh shaitan us ke sath khane laga."
"188","[AI-translation] Haddasana Yahya bin Musa, qala: Haddasana Abu Dawud, qala: Haddasana Hisham Ad-Dastuwa'i, 'an Budeel Al-Uqayli, 'an Abdullah bin Ubayd bin Umayr, 'an Umm Kulthum, 'an Aisha, qalat: Qala Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam: Jab tum mein se koi khaye, aur apne khaane par Allah ta'ala ka zikr karna bhool jaye, toh keh de: Bismillahi awwalahu wa akhirahu."
"189","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abdullah bin As-Sabbah Al-Hashimi Al-Basri, qala: Haddasana Abd al-A'la, 'an Ma'mar, 'an Hisham bin Urwah, 'an abihi, 'an Umar bin Abi Salamah, ke woh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas dakhil hue, aur un ke paas khaana tha. Toh aap ne farmaya: Aage aao aye bete, Allah ta'ala ka naam lo, aur apne daahine haath se khao, aur jo tere saamne ho us se khao."
